WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:02.740
Chara-su!

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.730
Is everyone shugo-peppy today?

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.090
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:11.260
With Pucchi Puchi and Dokki Doki, there's plenty of anime!

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.490
I can't wait!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.160
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:15.460
Unlock!

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:32.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:40.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:47.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:53.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:57.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:01.140
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:04.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:07.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:10.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:14.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:18.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:21.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:24.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:28.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:32.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:35.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:39.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.500
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.580
"What's the category?"

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:58.200
Ready, set...

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:00.000
Draw a blank and you lose!

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.710
What's the category?

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.940
Things Amu-chan likes to eat!

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:06.350
Katsudon!

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.190
Taiyaki!

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:10.340
Mille-feuille!

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:12.930
Soy products!

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:14.020
Beef bowls!

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:15.860
Banana youkan!

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:17.990
Panna cotta!

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:19.730
Bifidobacterium!

00:02:19.730 --> 00:02:20.970
Hey!

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:24.840
Bifidobacterium isn't a food, you know.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.200
At least say yogurt or something.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.520
Oh, right...

00:02:28.520 --> 00:02:30.800
You're so careless.

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:33.320
Wait, Amu-chan?!

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:34.890
Why are you here?

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:36.910
This is Pucchi Puchi!

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:38.880
Well, why not, once in a while?

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:42.500
I guess so. Just don't get in
the way of our game, okay?

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.740
Sure, fine, fine. Please, continue.

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.310
This time I'll say the category!

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:50.520
Draw a blank and you lose!

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.310
What's the category?

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:53.930
Amu-chan's screw-ups!

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:56.950
Falling down the stairs!

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:58.950
Forgetting her homework!

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:01.640
Mixing up her math and
Japanese textbooks!

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:05.580
Putting soy sauce in her miso soup
while spaced out at breakfast!

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:09.020
Going to school with bed-head.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.580
She wore her socks inside
out all day yesterday!

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.080
Enough!

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:15.170
Man, you're butting in again?

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:17.050
Despite this being Pucchi Puchi!

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:19.010
We were all having such
a good time, too!

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:20.880
S-Sorry, but...

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:23.090
Okay, I'll start this time!

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:25.790
The next category is this!

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:27.530
People Amu-chan is in love with!

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:30.020
Tadase-kun!

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:31.750
I-

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.060
Stop it!

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.770
Sheesh, Amu-chan!

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:36.310
Why not? We're just playing.

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:38.900
And yet this is <i>Pucchi Puchi</i>!

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:42.610
Yeah, well... Maybe that wasn't
the best category.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:44.670
Then what should we do?

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:45.660
Um...

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:47.890
Things Amu-chan are bad at?

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:49.270
That's not exactly...

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.830
Amu-chan's embarrassing
misunderstandings?

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:52.770
Like I said...

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:55.520
Oh, man! Stop complaining
about everything!

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.510
So, how about this?

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:59.190
The best things about Amu-chan.

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:01.070
Yeah, that'd be fine!

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:02.660
Okay, here we go!

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.430
This category...

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:09.120
It's too difficult...

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:12.950
Why, you little...

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:14.760
See you again!

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.490
Shugo-shugo Dance Lesson!

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:22.200
Let's split up the "Thank you, I'm so grateful"
dance into four parts and memorize it!

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:24.030
Today it's Lesson 4!

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.480
The first dance step is this!

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:27.100
Look at the example.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:33.000
arigatou zenbu ni kansha!

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.830
Let's try this far together.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.300
It's the same dance as Lesson 1!

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:39.650
Spin your hand around...

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:41.700
...and do the "chara-su!" pose!

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:45.490
Make a big heart, and then
little heart beats!

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:47.500
Okay?

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.880
Now let's try dancing to the music!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:54.720
arigatou zenbu ni kansha!

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:56.790
Could you do it?

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:58.840
Then, let's look at the next dance step!

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:07.430
sunao ni ieru sore mo
kimi no okage ka na

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.350
Let's try this far together!

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:11.660
Shake your hips to the side...

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.610
1-2-3!

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:15.760
Add your hands... 1-2-3!

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:18.380
Once more... 1-2-3!

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:22.040
Point your finger three
times... Blow a kiss!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.310
Now, once more with the music!

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:32.860
sunao ni ieru sore mo
kimi no okage ka na

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:34.690
Could you do it?

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:36.830
Now, this is the final dance step!

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.620
Let's try it together!

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.840
After you blow the kiss...

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:52.370
Wag, wag, wag...

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:56.540
Jump, jump! Jump, jump, jump!

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:59.180
And pose however you like at the end!

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.320
Okay!

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.670
Finally, let's try doing
the whole lesson at once!

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:10.650
arigatou zenbu ni kansha!

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:18.060
sunao ni ieru sore mo
kimi no okage ka na

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:27.870
Yay, it's finished!

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:33.270
Today, you can dance the entire thing
for the ending of the program!

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:35.130
We can't wait!

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:43.720
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.480
"Spell"

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:52.770
The wind sure is strong today.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:56.000
They call this wind "the first of spring."

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:00.670
Wasn't that Kiseki's crown?

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.050
A crab!

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:04.680
A teru-teru bouzu!

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:10.380
That's quite a lot of things that flew by.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:13.730
We need to be careful not
to blow away ourselves.

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:18.930
Ran, Su!

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:21.980
That was a shock...

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.530
Su, you've lost your clover!

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.860
Wait, please!

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:35.950
I thought it flew over this way, but...

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:39.200
But it's a field full of clovers
that all look the same.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.850
Can we find it?

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:42.460
Anyway, let's search!

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:43.250
Yeah!

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:51.950
Su...

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.470
Don't worry, I'm sure we'll find it!

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:55.870
Let's search more carefully!

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.530
Ran, Miki...

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:00.700
Sure!

00:08:03.770 --> 00:08:04.990
What's the matter?

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:05.980
Dia...

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:08.490
Su lost her clover.

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:09.900
Oh, no...

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:12.590
Ah... At times like this, there's a spell.

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:15.420
Everyone do this, and smile.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:16.910
This is a spell?

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.190
Yes. Now smile.

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:20.800
Smile...

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.200
Smile!

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:24.060
Smile...

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.640
Smile...

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.910
There you are!

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.880
Su! You dropped something!

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:31.860
It's Su's clover!

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:36.070
Isn't that nice, Su?

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:39.490
Yes! Thank you, everyone!

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:42.960
But wow... What a great
spell for finding things!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.620
That's not it.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:48.580
That was a spell to make
everyone happy.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.810
A spell to make...

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.280
...everyone happy?

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:55.830
Then, let's all do the spell once more!

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:57.380
Smile...

00:08:57.380 --> 00:08:58.790
Smile...

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:00.060
Smile...

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.520
Smile!

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:06.940
The End!

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:11.610
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:15.070
Today's episode is:
"A Heart-racing Dokki Doki!"

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:17.580
Ikuto... Ikuto's there!

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:19.940
Yeah! In Amu-chan's room!

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:22.650
I guess today is going
to be a special story.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:38.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:42.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:52.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:58.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:09:58.350 --> 00:10:03.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:08.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:16.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:22.290
I have something to say.

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:28.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:34.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:10:34.580 --> 00:10:39.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:46.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:16.230
Why are <i>you</i> here?!

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.950
What? You didn't hear from Utau?

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.300
I'm back in Japan temporarily for
some paperwork or something.

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:23.640
You see-nya?

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:26.040
Back temporarily?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.330
So you'll be leaving again.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.540
That's not what I meant!

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:35.240
Why are you in <i>my</i> room?

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:37.500
A-Anyway, move it!

00:11:37.910 --> 00:11:38.820
Amu-chan!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:39.800
This is bad!

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:40.960
What?

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.250
Amu-chan!

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:43.500
I'm coming in!

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:45.380
Wait a second!

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:47.050
Uh...

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:47.810
Hey!

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:48.950
Listen to-

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.870
Quiet, you!

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.620
What is it, Mom?

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.960
Huh? Where's Ikuto-kun?

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:59.130
After I told him you hadn't come home
yet and he said he'd come back,

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:01.240
I let him up to your room, but...

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.430
You let him in here?

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:04.070
Yes, she did.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.840
Ikuto-kun, what are you doing in there?

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:08.960
I just thought I'd surprise her...

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:12.290
Aw, it looks like you're actually
a kid at heart...

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:15.210
Anyway, take your time.

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:18.090
U-Uh...

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.540
I told you to listen to me...

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:22.860
We didn't sneak in or anything-nya.

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:27.290
I couldn't betray your mother's
trust, after all.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:30.720
Sorry.

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:36.020
Hey, would you come
out with me for a bit?

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:36.770
Huh?

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:43.610
25 - A Heart-racing Dokki Doki!

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:47.100
Easter bought this place...

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:48.350
Did you know?

00:12:58.490 --> 00:12:59.580
Okay.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:02.440
Let's go have fun somewhere.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.120
And, why the merry-go-round?

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.360
The coffee cups are too small.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:12.530
Not that! Why on the same horse?

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:14.230
And wait, this is even smaller!

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:17.570
Just playing Prince is all.

00:13:17.570 --> 00:13:18.790
Like this...

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:21.830
Wait... I'm not really the
Prince character...

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:23.960
How should I know? Whatever, get away!

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:26.110
Right back into Ikuto's flow...

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.620
You don't hold on tight and you'll fall.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.890
Well, it always turns out like this.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:29.350
I said, give me some room!

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.350
Indeed...

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:35.140
Sheesh, you're such a troublesome Princess.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:41.250
Tadase-kun?

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.850
Uh, Ikuto forced me to!

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:45.010
And why are you here?

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.610
Silly, what are you getting
so worked up about?

00:13:47.610 --> 00:13:48.340
Tadase was...

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:49.000
Quiet!

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:49.640
Amu-chan...

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.420
What?!

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.640
Ikuto-niisan invited me here as well.

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.340
Oh...

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:59.480
You really don't listen to
people, you know that?

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.840
Long time no see, my stray cat!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:06.150
Hey, wannabe King.

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.780
I am not a wannabe!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.280
Why you dumb cat!

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.350
What did you say?

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:12.150
I am a King!

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:14.520
They see each other after a long time
and it immediately becomes this.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:16.850
Well, it's always like that, you know.

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:17.870
Isn't it...

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.600
Ikuto-niisan...

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:22.800
Is your paperwork finished?

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:23.840
Yeah.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:27.090
So, what kind of paperwork
are you talking about?

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.460
I've joined an orchestra.

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:30.430
An orchestra?

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:34.690
It's the orchestra that used to
take care of my old man.

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:37.980
They invited me, saying they didn't
mind me being an apprentice.

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:40.660
I see.

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.170
Where are they?

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:44.680
They don't have any fixed
base of operations.

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:47.030
They go where the wind takes them.

00:14:47.810 --> 00:14:51.670
They're people traveling and
performing around the world.

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:53.200
When do you leave?

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.520
The tour will start soon.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:58.300
I leave tomorrow.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:01.000
I won't be returning to Japan for now.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.710
You're leaving already?

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.000
Hurry and grow up.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.170
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:22.100
Yoru, we're leaving.

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:24.510
Yeah!

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:27.980
See you later-nya!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:30.650
Until next time!

00:15:32.270 --> 00:15:33.790
Stay well, 'kay?

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:35.850
Sure.

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:37.860
Later.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.850
There Ikuto goes again.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:49.460
Yeah.

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:54.710
Well, I'm used to him appearing
and disappearing on a whim by now.

00:15:54.710 --> 00:15:55.670
Amu-chan!

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:01.460
Tadase!

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:02.940
What?

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:04.100
Amu-chan.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.380
Yes?

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:10.980
I'll always be by your side.

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.680
Are you okay, Amu-chan?

00:16:16.680 --> 00:16:18.920
I think she broke.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:21.930
That was quite a fierce attack.

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:24.350
That's our Tadase-kun, indeed...

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:25.500
My Prince...

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:33.510
I am no mere Prince!

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:35.020
I am a King!

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:38.070
Of all the moments...

00:16:38.070 --> 00:16:40.010
<i>This</i> is the one they...

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.410
It looks like everyone is here.

00:17:02.770 --> 00:17:03.790
Right!

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:05.580
Then, I guess we should begin.

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:12.450
Hiiragi Rikka-kun!

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:13.760
Y-Yes?

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:21.380
I-I'm sorry!

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:23.280
Calm down, do not rush.

00:17:23.280 --> 00:17:24.330
'kay...

00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:32.470
Hiiragi Rikka-kun.

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:38.450
I recognize you as the new Queen's Chair of the
Seiyo Academy Elementary School Guardians!

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:42.410
And so I present to you this Royal Cape.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:43.580
Right!

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:50.270
Lookin' good!

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.830
Congratulations, new Queen's Chair.

00:17:52.830 --> 00:17:54.410
It looks great on you.

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:55.840
Congratulations!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.560
Congratulations, Rikka!

00:17:57.560 --> 00:17:58.470
Congratulations.

00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:02.270
Con-gra-tu-lations! Congratulations!

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:10.290
Now continue to work hard under
your superior, Yaya-senpai!

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:11.370
That's right!

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:13.880
And you hurry up and give birth
to a Guardian Egg, Hikaru-chi...

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.100
I did.

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:19.110
A Guardian Egg? I got one.

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:24.460
When? When was yours born?

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:27.000
41 hours, three minutes ago.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:29.320
Why didn't you say anything about
something so important?

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:31.540
I was waiting for you to ask.

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:34.660
Sheesh...

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:37.970
I guess we don't have to worry about
the Guardians next year.

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:39.680
Although...

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:46.370
I'd like you all to continue working as Guardians
until tomorrow's graduation ceremony.

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:51.030
Graduation...

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:53.360
We'll be in middle school this spring...

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.740
Serious-time is over!

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:04.370
Leave the rest to me and the gang!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:07.260
The rest of you graduate with
a cheerful smile on your face!

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:08.490
That's an order!

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:09.640
You heard the ladies.

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:10.580
Correct.

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.460
A cheerful smile?

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:16.840
Yeah, you're right.

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.220
It's a place where I've made
many memories.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.830
So part of me doesn't
want to graduate...

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:25.560
But, I'm sure...

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:27.860
A new school!

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:30.040
A new classroom!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:32.390
New studies!

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:34.640
New friends!

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:36.490
And a new me!

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:42.270
The person I want to be...

00:20:03.450 --> 00:20:07.390
For some reason...
My heart's starting to race!

00:20:09.110 --> 00:20:12.010
Oh yeah! Why don't we all take
a picture to commemorate!

00:20:12.010 --> 00:20:13.210
Sounds nice!

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:14.480
Take it, take it!

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.430
But, who has a camera?

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:17.790
If you don't mind...

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:19.230
Nice!

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:22.570
Smile!

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:26.670
Then, here we go!

00:20:26.670 --> 00:20:28.370
A heart-racing...

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.950
Dokki Doki!

00:20:31.550 --> 00:20:35.170
Wait, don't you usually say
"cheese" or something?

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:38.230
Whatever, just smile!

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:40.500
Yeah, don't sweat the details!

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:43.220
A heart-racing smile!

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:45.510
That's right! The smile
is the most important!

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:48.680
Sheesh, you guys are really into it.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:52.240
But you're right... Smiles are the best!

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:59.980
Some days later...

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:54.990
Thank you for your support! Bye-bye!

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:59.470
We have an announcement to make.

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:02.720
This will be the last episode
of Shugo Chara Party.

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:06.520
Thank you for watching us every week!

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:09.900
Now, Eggs, please say a word!

00:22:09.900 --> 00:22:12.990
Everyone, did you find
who you want to be?

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:15.160
Thanks for watching all this time!

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:19.750
Thank you so much to all of you who've
watched Shugo Chara each week.

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:21.470
It was a lot of fun!

00:22:22.060 --> 00:22:24.750
I'm so glad I was able to become
part of Shugo Chara Egg!

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:26.630
We'll do our best from now on!

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:31.050
Being in Shugo Chara Egg! was a
lot of fun in all kinds of ways!

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:32.570
Thank you very much.

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:34.170
Okay!

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:36.820
Okay, bring her home, girls...

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:37.760
Right!

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:39.280
Everyone's hearts:

00:22:39.280 --> 00:22:42.500
Lock On! Open Heart!

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:44.960
Bye-bye!

00:22:54.460 --> 00:23:01.840
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:23:01.840 --> 00:23:06.670
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:16.520
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:23:16.520 --> 00:23:22.050
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:27.350
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:23:27.350 --> 00:23:32.200
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:40.180
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:23:40.180 --> 00:23:45.990
I have something to say.

00:23:47.380 --> 00:23:51.930
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:23:51.930 --> 00:23:58.280
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:23:58.280 --> 00:24:02.790
Thank you, for everything!

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:10.360
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:19.930
We're so grateful! Thank you, everyone!!

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:25.190
Thank you for watching.
